msgstr "ເກັບຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອໄວ້ໃນໄດຣຟ໌ຂອງໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ"

msgid "Files moved to the trash from other drives are copied into the trash in your home folder, so those drives get no .Trash-1000 folder. Moving large files to the trash then takes longer."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຍ້າຍໄປຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອຈາກໄດຣຟ໌ອື່ນຈະຖືກສຳເນົາໄປຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອໃນໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໄດຣຟ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີໂຟນເດີ .Trash-1000. ການຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່ໄປຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Full trash:"
msgstr "ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອເຕັມ:"

msgid "When the limit is reached:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຖິງຂີດຈຳກັດ:"

msgid "Show a warning"
msgstr "ສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນ"

msgid "Delete the oldest items"
msgstr "ລຶບລາຍການທີ່ເກົ່າທີ່ສຸດ"

msgid "Delete the largest items"
msgstr "ລຶບລາຍການທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດ"

msgid "These used to be KDE system settings. Limits are applied when Beluga starts and after moving items to the trash."
msgstr "ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຄີຍເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບຂອງ KDE. ຂີດຈຳກັດຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອ Beluga ເລີ່ມ ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກຍ້າຍລາຍການໄປຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ."

msgid "Calculating trash size…"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຄິດໄລ່ຂະໜາດຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ…"

msgid "The trash currently uses %s."
msgstr "ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອໃຊ້ %s ຢູ່ໃນຕອນນີ້."

msgid "_Empty Trash Now"
msgstr "ລ້າງຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອດຽວນີ້ (_E)"

msgid "Vim Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດ Vim"

msgid "Vim mode:"
msgstr "ໂໝດ Vim:"

msgid "Use Vim-like keys in the views"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມແບບ Vim ໃນມຸມມອງ"

msgid "Normal mode moves with h j k l and runs the keys below; v, V and Ctrl+V select; i and a rename (insert mode); Esc goes back to normal mode; : opens the command line. Keys with Ctrl or Alt that aren't listed here keep their usual meaning."
msgstr "ໂໝດປົກກະຕິເຄື່ອນທີ່ດ້ວຍ h j k l ແລະ ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ປຸ່ມຂ້າງລຸ່ມ; v, V ແລະ Ctrl+V ເລືອກ; i ແລະ a ປ່ຽນຊື່ (ໂໝດແຊກ); Esc ກັບໄປໂໝດປົກກະຕິ; : ເປີດແຖວຄຳສັ່ງ. ປຸ່ມ Ctrl ຫຼື Alt ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸໄວ້ນີ້ຍັງມີຄວາມໝາຍຕາມປົກກະຕິ."

msgid "Leader key:"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມນຳ:"

msgid "<leader> in the keys below, e.g. <Space> or ,"
msgstr "<leader> ໃນປຸ່ມຂ້າງລຸ່ມ, ເຊັ່ນ <Space> ຫຼື ,"

msgid "Wait for more keys:"
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າປຸ່ມເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

msgid "ms (dd after d, gg after g)"
msgstr "ms (dd ຫຼັງ d, gg ຫຼັງ g)"

msgid "Keys"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ"

msgid "Vim notation, several separated by spaces: h, gg, <C-v>, <CR>, <Esc>, <leader>t. Leave a field empty for the default."
msgstr "ສັນຍາລັກ Vim, ຫຼາຍອັນແຍກດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ: h, gg, <C-v>, <CR>, <Esc>, <leader>t. ປ່ອຍຊ່ອງວ່າງໄວ້ສຳລັບຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ."

msgid ":q closes the window (:q! without asking about its tabs), :qa quits Beluga, :e or :cd PATH opens a folder, :tabnew [PATH], :tabclose, :tabonly, :sp or :vs [PATH] split the view, :only closes the other view, :mkdir NAME, :touch NAME, :set hidden / nohidden / hidden!, :set view=icons|compact|details|columns, :sort name|size|date|type, :pwd, :term, :du, :help, :!COMMAND runs a shell command in the folder."
msgstr ":q ປິດໜ້າຕ່າງ (:q! ໂດຍບໍ່ຖາມກ່ຽວກັບແຖບ), :qa ອອກຈາກ Beluga, :e ຫຼື :cd ເສັ້ນທາງ ເປີດໂຟນເດີ, :tabnew [ເສັ້ນທາງ], :tabclose, :tabonly, :sp ຫຼື :vs [ເສັ້ນທາງ] ແບ່ງມຸມມອງ, :only ປິດມຸມມອງອື່ນ, :mkdir ຊື່, :touch ຊື່, :set hidden / nohidden / hidden!, :set view=icons|compact|details|columns, :sort name|size|date|type, :pwd, :term, :du, :help, :!ຄຳສັ່ງ ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງເຊວໃນໂຟນເດີ."

